    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mover><mo>→</mo><mi>dehydrohalogenation</mi></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math><br /><br />In alcoholic KOH alkoxide ions <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> are present which is a strong base. They abstract proton from beta carbon of alkyl halide and favours elimination reaction<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mover><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math>",
